  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nExpanding on the discussion and resolution in https://github.com/w3ctag/design-reviews/issues/1210, a switch of the return type from `undefined` to `Promise` should also be considered for [`NavigateEvent.scroll()`](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/NavigateEvent/scroll). Since an intercept handler is already async, it would make a lot of sense to be able to defer logic until native scroll has completed.\n\n@mustaqahmed ",
